  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "A robot moves in a plane starting from point (0, 0). The robot can perform three types of moves:\n\n\n'G': Go one unit forward in current direction\n'L': Turn left (90 degrees counter-clockwise)\n'R': Turn right (90 degrees clockwise)\nGiven a sequence of moves, determine if the robot returns to its starting position after executing all moves.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe only line of input contains SSS - the string of moves\n\n\nOutput Format\n\nPrint \"YES\" if the robot returns to starting position\nPrint \"NO\" otherwise",
    "constraints": [
      "1 ≤ |S| ≤ 10^5"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
